# train_13: acceptable if at least one of two plans is completed.
# Plan one: visit A then, strictly later, visit B, while never entering
# hazard zone X. Plan two: visit overflow dock D at least once.
# Completing both plans is allowed (this is a disjunction, not exclusive-or).
any_of(
    all_of(order(A, B), avoid(X)),
    visit(D)
)
